<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54162" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατα-κλείς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εῖδος</span>,
		or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάκλεις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ειδος</span>, 
			Ion.
		 and 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατα-κληΐς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ηῖδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>instrument for shutting</i> or
				<i>fastening doors</i>, distd. from the bolt (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοχλός</span>) and bolt-pin (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάλανος</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				154
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).158
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				65
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>, pl.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ κ. τῶν ἀξόνων</span>
			<i>linch-pins</i>, prob.l.in <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				17.53
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pawl, check-hook</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				68.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Bel.</u>
				79.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακληΐς βελέμνων</span>
			<i>case</i> for arrows, quiver, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Dian.</u>
				82
			</span></i>; <i>cap</i> or <i>case</i> fitted to an engine, <i><span class="en">
				Bito
				59.3
			</span></i>; also, <i>socket</i> for the arrow in the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαστραφέτης</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				62.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> pl.,
				<i>locks</i> on a canal, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				2p.43
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>sheath for a pin</i>, in pl., Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				18.294
			</span></i>, Aristeas<i><span class="en">
				65
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κληῖδα</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρώμιον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				48.48.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.62
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.766
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>first rib</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				18(2).956
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>clavicular region</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				14.703
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				4.13.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>final remark, conclusion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				9.18.3
			</span></i>, prob. l. in ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.3.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>close of a verse</i> or <i>set of verses</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heph.
				5.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristid.Quint.
				1.27
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				659
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
